content.thinking:
The bundled certs expired in 2021. So a TLS section using them can't work as-is. Options:
1. Generate fresh certs in the test at runtime (complex).
2. Use `caFile = "NONE"` (disable peer verification) for the client — tests TLS transport without cert validation. That still exercises the TLS code path (encrypted connection), which is what the requirement cares about ("现有TLS连接" — behavior applies over TLS connections).

